1
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:28,160
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:31,120
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:34,160
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:37,680
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:40,080
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,080
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

7
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:46,040
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:49,400
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:08,280
♪Mild face covers all my pride♪

10
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:11,000
♪Quiet breath hides my sharp mind♪

11
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:12,840
♪Bearing hurt, I stand aside♪

12
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,640
A wolf?

13
00:01:14,799 --> 00:01:15,799
Why a wolf?

14
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,439
You come when called,

15
00:01:17,599 --> 00:01:18,760
but won't go away.

16
00:01:19,719 --> 00:01:20,560
And your eyes

17
00:01:20,959 --> 00:01:21,760
are like a wolf's.

18
00:01:22,799 --> 00:01:23,760
They devour people.

19
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:26,720
♪All disguise I keep in sight♪

20
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:29,600
♪Wait the chance to win the fight♪

21
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:33,080
♪I don't lean on anyone's hand♪

22
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:36,080
♪I hold my fate in my own command♪

23
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:38,079
♪Silent plans are taking flight♪

24
00:01:38,079 --> 00:01:39,439
Well, I'll eat you alive.

25
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:42,360
♪I'm gonna break the endless night♪

26
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:45,440
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

27
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:48,400
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

28
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:51,600
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

29
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:55,080
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

30
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,200
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

31
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,120
=Quite The Girl=

32
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:06,640
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl")

33
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,080
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

34
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,320
♪Good girl♪
=Episode 7=

35
00:02:10,199 --> 00:02:11,879
Marrying Mingyu into the Qin family,

36
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,560
where does that leave our dignity?

37
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,719
What dignity do we have left now?

38
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,520
Ever since you

39
00:02:23,759 --> 00:02:25,599
brought Lu Mingyu back a decade ago,

40
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:27,280
you and Mom started sleeping
in separate rooms.

41
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:29,360
You put your focus

42
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:31,080
entirely on Lu Mingyu.

43
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:32,639
To me,

44
00:02:33,439 --> 00:02:34,120
to Mom,

45
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,120
to Lu Qian,

46
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,840
isn't that a humiliation?

47
00:02:36,919 --> 00:02:37,199
You...

48
00:02:37,199 --> 00:02:37,960
Hit me!

49
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:39,159
Hit me.

50
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,280
Hit me!

51
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:42,680
Even if you beat me to death,

52
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:44,080
you won't change the fact

53
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:46,800
that this family is already disgraced
in Xizi City!

54
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,680
Instead of caring
about this petty reputation,

55
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,759
you'd better consider

56
00:02:53,319 --> 00:02:55,960
how to take our family even higher.

57
00:02:56,759 --> 00:02:58,080
We have no shame left anyway.

58
00:02:58,719 --> 00:03:00,120
So what if we profit from it?

59
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:02,400
Dad.

60
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,879
I advise you to think carefully.

61
00:03:05,919 --> 00:03:07,080
What do we have left

62
00:03:07,319 --> 00:03:09,039
to fight the Qin family with?

63
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:11,639
What are your odds?

64
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:16,039
Two daughters marrying the same man
one after another...

65
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:18,199
That's neither proper
nor good for our name.

66
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,520
So won't people talk?

67
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:21,840
Where's Mingyu?

68
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,039
Your dear Mingyu

69
00:03:25,879 --> 00:03:26,960
went out early this morning.

70
00:03:34,199 --> 00:03:35,560
(Lu Mingyu,)

71
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:39,520
(I'll never let you marry anyone else.)

72
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:44,439
Today I'll teach you self-defense,

73
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,159
so you can protect yourself

74
00:03:46,159 --> 00:03:46,919
when I'm not around.

75
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:48,879
Okay.

76
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,039
When you're grabbed,

77
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,599
don't waste your strength fighting me.

78
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,879
Move closer to me.

79
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,400
Lean your body back.

80
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:04,879
Bend at the waist.

81
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:07,319
♪They all believe♪

82
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:08,960
Cross your hands over mine.

83
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:14,360
♪Love begins at first sight♪

84
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,039
Push.

85
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:22,400
♪When Cupid's arrow flies♪

86
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:27,760
♪Through two gazing eyes♪

87
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:31,480
Feel my center of gravity.

88
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,839
When I move forward, you step back.

89
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:40,680
♪Passing by under green lights♪

90
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:45,959
♪In the airport corner, bags between us♪

91
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:46,680
Three.

92
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:47,839
Two.

93
00:04:48,639 --> 00:04:49,199
One.

94
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:54,680
♪Or someone dialed the wrong number♪

95
00:04:55,720 --> 00:05:00,279
♪Fate's signal's always weak♪

96
00:05:00,279 --> 00:05:01,160
Stop struggling.

97
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:02,879
Use your hips.

98
00:05:04,199 --> 00:05:04,959
Push up.

99
00:05:09,319 --> 00:05:10,319
Hold my waist.

100
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,160
Then roll over.

101
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:15,480
♪Cover both ears, hide all the clues♪

102
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:19,720
♪One by one, they pass
before love is entrusted♪

103
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,279
Nice.

104
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,480
In this position,

105
00:05:23,079 --> 00:05:24,600
you can do anything to me.

106
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,759
Remember the feeling.

107
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,519
Feel every response

108
00:05:29,519 --> 00:05:30,839
my body gives you.

109
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,399
Where it's soft,

110
00:05:32,639 --> 00:05:33,360
where it's hard,

111
00:05:33,879 --> 00:05:34,839
where it's exerting strength.

112
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:38,839
♪We share a ride across time♪

113
00:05:38,839 --> 00:05:40,639
Coach Duan,

114
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,639
is this how you teach all your students?

115
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:47,440
♪In childhood albums, my lover's face♪

116
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,480
It's only for you.

117
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:53,120
♪He found the kite we lost♪

118
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:59,960
♪Fate's signal's always weak♪

119
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,399
Hello, Mom.

120
00:06:01,879 --> 00:06:02,839
(Come back right now.)

121
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,199
(I need to see you soon.)

122
00:06:04,399 --> 00:06:05,480
I'll go back tomorrow morning.

123
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:13,800
♪Cover both ears, hide all the clues♪

124
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:16,279
♪One by one, they pass
before love is entrusted♪

125
00:06:16,279 --> 00:06:17,480
I may be gone for a few days.

126
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,839
I'll be back to marry you.

127
00:06:22,319 --> 00:06:23,120
Okay.

128
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:24,519
Tonight,

129
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,160
don't go back.

130
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:27,759
Come to my place

131
00:06:28,399 --> 00:06:29,279
and enjoy some art.

132
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:37,959
♪Cover both ears, hide all the clues♪

133
00:06:37,959 --> 00:06:39,600
Only enjoy the art?

134
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:47,020
♪One by one, they pass
before love is entrusted♪

135
00:06:49,639 --> 00:06:51,360
We can do something else too.

136
00:06:51,839 --> 00:06:53,000
Let's balance work and pleasure.

137
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:55,879
My bed is big.

138
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:02,680
We can practice self-defense all night.

139
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,680
I'm tired.

140
00:07:08,879 --> 00:07:09,480
I'm out.

141
00:07:13,639 --> 00:07:15,199
I really miss those two times.

142
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,560
Give me a kiss.

143
00:07:18,439 --> 00:07:19,439
Just treat it

144
00:07:20,279 --> 00:07:21,160
as a teaching reward.

145
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:24,880
♪We crossed paths
till our eyes met at last♪

146
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:30,960
♪A new beginning, the next chapter cast♪

147
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:36,040
♪Three thousand sunsets
before fate drew near♪

148
00:07:36,840 --> 00:07:40,000
♪All for this moment with you♪

149
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,639
Why are you here?

150
00:07:58,279 --> 00:07:59,160
Where's Ye?

151
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,720
She's been busy lately.

152
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,439
I'm afraid she can't visit you.

153
00:08:08,319 --> 00:08:09,519
She's getting married.

154
00:08:12,399 --> 00:08:15,000
He's the eldest son
of the Qin family in Xizi.

155
00:08:15,639 --> 00:08:16,879
Decent background.

156
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,319
But his reputation's terrible.

157
00:08:20,079 --> 00:08:21,199
He falls for every woman.

158
00:08:21,959 --> 00:08:23,000
This guy used to be

159
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,720
Lu Qian's boyfriend.

160
00:08:26,279 --> 00:08:28,000
Then he set his eyes on Ye.

161
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,959
The worst thing for a woman

162
00:08:30,879 --> 00:08:32,200
is marrying the wrong man.

163
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,480
Or your whole life

164
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,480
will be stuck in the mud.

165
00:08:48,399 --> 00:08:49,200
No way.

166
00:08:49,639 --> 00:08:51,200
Ye can't marry him.

167
00:08:54,279 --> 00:08:55,080
Mom.

168
00:08:57,159 --> 00:08:59,000
They're powerful and influential.

169
00:08:59,919 --> 00:09:01,120
I can't do anything about it.

170
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:02,759
Unless...

171
00:09:07,399 --> 00:09:08,159
Unless...

172
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:27,399
Let me...

173
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:30,559
see my dear Ye again.

174
00:09:31,919 --> 00:09:32,600
Okay.

175
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,000
Grandma.

176
00:09:47,679 --> 00:09:48,840
I'm here to see you.

177
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:50,639
Ye.

178
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,799
It's me, Grandma.

179
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:55,960
You finally recognized me.

180
00:09:56,279 --> 00:09:58,639
I haven't seen you smile in ages.

181
00:09:59,519 --> 00:10:00,720
Last time I saw you,

182
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:02,399
you were still little,

183
00:10:02,879 --> 00:10:05,039
and your parents were still here.

184
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,320
I'll take you out soon.

185
00:10:07,879 --> 00:10:09,399
Then we can spend
Chinese New Year together.

186
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:13,159
You're so talented and so smart.

187
00:10:13,559 --> 00:10:15,080
Everything you draw looks beautiful.

188
00:10:15,679 --> 00:10:17,320
This courtyard is too small

189
00:10:17,759 --> 00:10:19,080
to hold you.

190
00:10:19,879 --> 00:10:21,200
You need a bigger world

191
00:10:22,039 --> 00:10:24,039
and you should paint many paintings.

192
00:10:24,159 --> 00:10:25,000
Okay.

193
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,240
Let's go together.

194
00:10:26,759 --> 00:10:27,799
Silly child.

195
00:10:28,279 --> 00:10:29,759
These old bones of mine

196
00:10:29,919 --> 00:10:31,600
can't keep up with you forever.

197
00:10:32,519 --> 00:10:34,519
You have a long road ahead.

198
00:10:36,159 --> 00:10:38,320
Ultimately, your path is yours to take.

199
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:41,240
What are you saying, Grandma?

200
00:10:42,039 --> 00:10:43,840
I want to be with you forever.

201
00:10:43,919 --> 00:10:45,440
We'll be like when I was little.

202
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,799
When I'm hungry, you cook me noodles.

203
00:10:47,919 --> 00:10:49,679
When it's cold, you layer me up.

204
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:50,679
And then,

205
00:10:50,679 --> 00:10:52,799
I fall asleep in your arms
just like this.

206
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,039
Yeah.

207
00:10:56,799 --> 00:10:58,919
Someday, there will be someone

208
00:10:58,919 --> 00:11:00,679
who truly cares about you,

209
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:03,679
who dearly cherishes you.

210
00:11:04,039 --> 00:11:06,759
You deserve the best.

211
00:11:08,519 --> 00:11:10,240
Sit here and be a good girl.

212
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,679
In my room,

213
00:11:12,279 --> 00:11:15,440
I've saved a little thing you love.

214
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:16,960
I'll get it for you.

215
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:17,720
I'll come with you.

216
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,279
No need.

217
00:11:18,759 --> 00:11:20,000
I will go alone.

218
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:21,360
Very quick.

219
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,240
Very quick.

220
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:24,120
Okay. Don't be long.

221
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:24,879
Sure.

222
00:11:59,159 --> 00:12:00,039
Grandma?

223
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:02,840
Grandma, why are you locking the door?

224
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:13,279
Grandma!

225
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:15,440
What are you doing with the knife?

226
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:16,799
Ye.

227
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:21,159
Walk your own path.

228
00:12:21,679 --> 00:12:23,960
Remember what I told you.

229
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:26,240
Don't let anyone push you around.

230
00:12:26,799 --> 00:12:28,279
Live on.

231
00:12:28,679 --> 00:12:31,000
Live the way you want.

232
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:41,840
Grandma!

233
00:12:42,039 --> 00:12:43,799
No!

234
00:12:44,399 --> 00:12:46,480
Go now!

235
00:12:49,279 --> 00:12:50,840
Grandma!

236
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:15,759
Ye...

237
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:18,200
Push forward.

238
00:13:18,799 --> 00:13:20,159
Don't look back.

239
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:22,200
Be happy.

240
00:13:25,799 --> 00:13:27,840
Grandma!

241
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:12,080
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

242
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:18,560
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

243
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:26,240
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

244
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:32,400
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

245
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:41,320
♪A love letter written in song♪

246
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:46,600
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

247
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:55,040
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

248
00:14:55,640 --> 00:15:01,600
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

249
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:09,160
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

250
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:12,040
♪Close your eyes and count♪

251
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:16,920
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

252
00:15:16,920 --> 00:15:21,440
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
